flowchart LR
  U([Operador / sk]) -->|HTTP| GW[Gateway APISIX]
  GW -->|HTTP| API[API: ipm-permission-api]
  API -->|SQL: transação síncrona\npermission, outbox, idempotency| DB[(SSOT: banco ssot, schema ipm)]
  DB -->|outbox pendente por sequence| PUB[Publisher: ipm-permission-publisher]
  PUB -->|desired.ipm.permission.>| NATS[(JetStream: Stream DESIRED)]
  NATS -->|desired.changed / desired.deleted| CTRL[Controller: ipm-permission-controller]
  CTRL -->|1. lê intenção vigente| DB
  CTRL -->|2. observa role de projeto| ZIT["Zitadel: ProjectService\nroles-<módulo>"]
  CTRL -->|3. reconcilia role no projeto| ZIT
  CTRL -->|4. reobserva e atualiza status| DB
  NATS -->|catálogo de permissões| CONS[Consumidores:\nipm.role API,\nipm.organization Controller]
